      "overview": "At Binan High School in the city of Binan, Japan, Yufuin En and Kinugawa Atsushi, along with along with Naruko Io and Zaou Ryuu, enjoy leisurely high school lives while hosting meetings of a do-nothing club called the Earth Defense Club.",
